    "name": "Green Patty Pan Squash",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Green pattypan squash isa small, saucer-shaped summer squash with distinct scalloped edges. Also called scallop squash or cymling, varieties like </span><i><em class=\"lexical-text-editor--italic\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Benning's Green Tint</em></i><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> feature tender pale-green skin, a mild and slightly nutty flavor, and a slightly firmer, meatier texture than standard zucchini. </span></p>",
